{"resource":"lines/ps-guidance-counselor","about":"One budget line, every year and stage a document states it.","count":21,"caveats":["A STAGE IS NOT A PERIOD. There is no join between this table and `ledger_snapshot` and nothing should invent one.","An \"actual\" here is a RESTATEMENT: a prior year re-presented by the people who spent it, inside the argument for the next budget. It is not a ledger figure.","These lines do NOT sum back to the district totals -- between 0.1% and 1.6% out. Never apportion a total across them.","`documents_disagree` marks a figure two documents state differently. The documents disagree with themselves by up to 1.5%, which is larger than most variances anybody wants to measure.","FY2021 is unusable: 117 of 120 lines print the budget under an \"actual\" heading. Exclude it."],"provenance":{"documents":[{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget/text/budget-hearing-fy20-proposed-lps-budget.txt","path":"sources/district-budget/text/budget-hearing-fy20-proposed-lps-budget.txt","basis":"both","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":"096ff134aee4c3b815e351af694dd154722db98a007fd24748a7961c57af5e79","cited_as":"sources/district-budget/text/budget-hearing-fy20-proposed-lps-budget.txt"},{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget/text/final-fy25-budget-4-3-24.txt","path":"sources/district-budget/text/final-fy25-budget-4-3-24.txt","basis":"budget","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":"6742a3b3e9c42e4e794c7a2c0d3c5bb739c55ae15ff917f6b5a17dc4a9a2d811","cited_as":"sources/district-budget/text/final-fy25-budget-4-3-24.txt"},{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget/text/fy18-personnel-supt-recommended-budget-revised-6-6-17.txt","path":"sources/district-budget/text/fy18-personnel-supt-recommended-budget-revised-6-6-17.txt","basis":"budget","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":"4fa9a144c21ca3f38dc2336c61f8c245191e2745f2ff7508d1941a82c0f00603","cited_as":"sources/district-budget/text/fy18-personnel-supt-recommended-budget-revised-6-6-17.txt"},{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget